# House Hlaalu: Edryno Arethi's last duties, Vivec.
# "ebony trade" (HH_AshlanderEbony): gulakhan Ashibaal of the Zainab ("The Zainab are now strong enough to sell
# ebony." 3, "If we both sell ebony the price drops." 1: 50), reported (100). "Prelude" (HH_SunkenTreasure): the
# Daedric Wakizashi from the wreck's chest (AddItem stands in for looting it), handed over ("Give her" 1: 100).
# "Ralen Tilvur" (HH_GuardMerchant): the smith's greeting lets the thief Drarel Andus in (50); killed, reported (100).
# `approach`/PositionCell stand in for the travel; the kill for the fight.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_ashlander_ebony
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask ebony trade
expect GetJournalIndex HH_AshlanderEbony == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 114 482 -238 0 "Zainab Camp, Ashibaal's Yurt"
until 300 GetPCCell "Zainab Camp, Ashibaal's Yurt" == 1
approach 0570791D
talk ashibaal
ask ebony trade
choose 3
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_AshlanderEbony == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask ebony trade
expect GetJournalIndex HH_AshlanderEbony == 100
bye
end

case hh_prelude
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask Prelude
expect GetJournalIndex HH_SunkenTreasure == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3645 3204 176 0 "Prelude Shipwreck, Lower Level"
until 300 GetPCCell "Prelude Shipwreck, Lower Level" == 1
run
player->AddItem "daedric wakizashi_hhst" 1
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask Prelude
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_SunkenTreasure == 100
bye
end

case hh_guard_merchant
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask Ralen Tilvur
expect GetJournalIndex HH_GuardMerchant == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -95 -186 -92 0 "Vivec, Ralen Tilvur: Smith"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Ralen Tilvur: Smith" == 1
approach 05874C09
talk ralen tilvur
until 300 GetJournalIndex HH_GuardMerchant >= 50
console 05CFAD51.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "drarel andus" >= 1
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask Ralen Tilvur
expect GetJournalIndex HH_GuardMerchant == 100
bye
end
